!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/46c9b1d4b1fb3e1b7dcb3df46c8a7840.poster.avif?t=1706545574\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/46c9b1d4b1fb3e1b7dcb3df46c8a7840.webm?t=1706545574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/46c9b1d4b1fb3e1b7dcb3df46c8a7840.mp4?t=1706545574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Prepare for the night and try to survive the onslaught of enemies!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/6e670e45bd8825d4867ed9fa5f52ba70.poster.avif?t=1706545574\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/6e670e45bd8825d4867ed9fa5f52ba70.webm?t=1706545574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216880/extras/6e670e45bd8825d4867ed9fa5f52ba70.mp4?t=1706545574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
